  "takeaways": [
    "Size a call spread so that losing the full debit is acceptable.",
    "With a month or more left, buying back the cheap short call leaves an uncapped long call.",
    "Buying back the short leg adds money to the trade, so check your risk budget first."
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "The backtest models a plain call debit spread with a stop; it does not model buying back the short leg.",
    "The added cost increases the total risk of the position beyond the original debit."
